    "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Agenda FAQ</h2>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How do I build a custom agenda?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Attendees can bookmark sessions across tracks to create a personal schedule. Drag and drop any session into your lineup and export it to your calendar.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I filter the agenda by track?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes. Use the track selector above the schedule to show only the sessions that interest you. The full agenda returns when you clear the filter.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Will session materials be shared afterward?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Registered attendees receive slide decks and recordings for every session they bookmark within a week after the conference closes.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:column -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Are session times final?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>The published agenda is confirmed, but small adjustments can happen. We notify all registrants by email if any session time changes before the event opens.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:column -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
